      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FOREVER ONTHE TINS (3) is stepping out for the first time. By Tintin In America and hails from the Day stable. Has looked above average in winning his last two trials and is likely to get the favours from this nice draw so could kick off with a win. STAY MYSTERIOUS (8) has had nine months since an encouraging debut effort, coming from this barrier for a 1.6m second at this circuit and distance. May have developed with maturity and was readied with a nice trial. Strong claims. PRINCE OF POP (4) was fourth on debut two runs ago then started favourite but broke at the latest appearance. Has trialled since. Can be a force if the manners improve. SECOND SERVE (2) returns to the front line for the first time since he was runner-up at West Wyalong last month.",
